"Un Client ID tiene 32 letras y números. Cópialo desde la página de tu app."

#: src/ui/login.rs:461
msgid "Set up your Spotify app"
msgstr "Configura tu app de Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:469
msgid ""
"Spotifast signs in through your own free Spotify app. Spotify requires its "
"owner to have Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast inicia sesión con tu propia app gratuita de Spotify. Spotify exige "
"que su propietario tenga Premium."

